  "tip": "A mixed test of Units 10–12: festivals, plans and \"have to\". No new words.\n\n- Future: আমি **-ব**, তুই **-বি**, তুমি / সে **-বে**, আপনি **-বেন**. Won't: **খাব না**.\n- Have to: **আমাকে** যেতে হবে (the person takes **-কে**). Can and want keep আমি: **আমি** যেতে পারি / চাই.\n- **-তে হবে না** = don't have to, not \"mustn't\".\n- Couldn't: **পারিনি**. Will be able to: **পারব**.",
  "vocab": [],
